{
  "name": "Andes Freight — Extracción y validación de facturas",
  "meta": {
    "note": "Export sanitizado. Sin IDs de cuenta, credenciales ni datos reales de proveedores. Caso self-initiated de portfolio, negocio ficticio (Andes Freight, freight forwarding). Ver README.md de esta carpeta y docs/portfolio/N8N_CASES.md en lokebox-landing."
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "w01",
      "name": "Email Trigger - Facturas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mailbox": "INBOX",
        "options": {
          "forceReconnect": 60
        },
        "format": "resolved"
      },
      "notes": "Filtra por asunto/remitente de proveedores conocidos en el nodo siguiente, no acá — mantener el trigger simple y la lógica de negocio en nodos explícitos."
    },
    {
      "id": "w02",
      "name": "Upload Attachment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://<project>.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/facturas/' + Date.now() + '-' + $binary.attachment_0.fileName }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "inputDataFieldName": "attachment_0",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData"
      },
      "notes": "Sube el adjunto a Supabase Storage antes que nada, para tener una URL estable que sobreviva aunque el resto del pipeline falle."
    },
    {
      "id": "w03",
      "name": "Insert Factura (Raw)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "raw_email_subject",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Email Trigger - Facturas').item.json.subject }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "raw_email_from",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Email Trigger - Facturas').item.json.from }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "raw_attachment_url",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.Key }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Se inserta con estado='recibida' (default de la columna) apenas hay una URL de adjunto. Nunca se pierde el email de origen aunque la extracción falle después."
    },
    {
      "id": "w04",
      "name": "Extract With AI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-5\", \"thinking\": { \"type\": \"disabled\" }, \"max_tokens\": 500, \"messages\": [ { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [ { \"type\": \"image\", \"source\": { \"type\": \"base64\", \"media_type\": $('Email Trigger - Facturas').item.binary.attachment_0.mimeType, \"data\": $('Email Trigger - Facturas').item.binary.attachment_0.data } }, { \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Extraé de esta factura: proveedor, numero_factura, monto, moneda (ARS o USD), fecha_emision (formato AAAA-MM-DD), numero_oc si aparece, lineas (array de {descripcion, cantidad, precio_unitario}). Devolvé JSON con esos campos más confianza_extraccion (0-1). Respondé solo con ese JSON plano, sin texto alrededor y sin markdown.\" } ] } ] } }}",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyHeaders": "keypair",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Misma técnica de extracción con Claude vision que bot/claude.js en lokebox-app (producción real, distingue recibo de cheque), aplicada acá a facturas de proveedor."
    },
    {
      "id": "w05",
      "name": "Parse AI Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d1",
              "name": "proveedor",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.content.find(b => b.type === 'text').text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]).proveedor }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2",
              "name": "numero_factura",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.content.find(b => b.type === 'text').text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]).numero_factura }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d3",
              "name": "monto",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.content.find(b => b.type === 'text').text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]).monto }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d4",
              "name": "moneda",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.content.find(b => b.type === 'text').text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]).moneda }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d5",
              "name": "fecha_emision",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.content.find(b => b.type === 'text').text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]).fecha_emision }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d6",
              "name": "numero_oc",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.content.find(b => b.type === 'text').text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]).numero_oc || null }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d7",
              "name": "lineas",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.content.find(b => b.type === 'text').text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]).lineas }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d8",
              "name": "confianza_extraccion",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.content.find(b => b.type === 'text').text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/)[0]).confianza_extraccion }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "d9",
              "name": "factura_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Insert Factura (Raw)').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w06",
      "name": "Update Factura - Extraida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "estado",
              "fieldValue": "extraida"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "proveedor",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.proveedor }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "numero_factura",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.numero_factura }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "monto",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.monto }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "moneda",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.moneda }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "fecha_emision",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.fecha_emision }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "numero_oc",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.numero_oc }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "lineas",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.lineas }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "confianza_extraccion",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.confianza_extraccion }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.factura_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w07",
      "name": "Check Duplicate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "proveedor",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.proveedor }}"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "numero_factura",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.numero_factura }}"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "neq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Edge case: mismo proveedor + mismo número de factura ya existe (reenvío de email, o doble carga por error).",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "id": "w08",
      "name": "If Duplicate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w09",
      "name": "Mark Duplicada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        -100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "estado",
              "fieldValue": "duplicada"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Update Factura - Extraida').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w10",
      "name": "Notify - Duplicada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        -100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": "#andesfreight-cuentas-a-pagar",
        "text": "=Factura {{ $json.numero_factura }} de {{ $json.proveedor }} llegó de nuevo, se marcó duplicada, no se generó una excepción nueva."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w11",
      "name": "If Confianza Baja",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.confianza_extraccion }}",
              "rightValue": 0.75,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lt"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Edge case: OCR/extracción de baja confianza nunca se adivina, va a cola de aprobación con el motivo explícito."
    },
    {
      "id": "w12",
      "name": "Mark Excepcion Baja Confianza",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1980,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "estado",
              "fieldValue": "excepcion_baja_confianza"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "motivo_excepcion",
              "fieldValue": "={{ \"confianza_extraccion=\" + $('Parse AI Response').item.json.confianza_extraccion + \" por debajo del umbral 0.75\" }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Update Factura - Extraida').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w13",
      "name": "Check OC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "ordenes_compra",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "numero_oc",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Parse AI Response').item.json.numero_oc }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "id": "w14",
      "name": "If Sin OC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.numero_oc }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notExists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Edge case: factura sin orden de compra asociada (numero_oc vacío, o no existe en el catálogo) va a excepción explícita, nunca se concilia a ciegas."
    },
    {
      "id": "w15",
      "name": "Mark Excepcion Sin OC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2200,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "estado",
              "fieldValue": "excepcion_sin_oc"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "motivo_excepcion",
              "fieldValue": "Sin orden de compra asociada"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Update Factura - Extraida').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w16",
      "name": "Compute Diff Monto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2200,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const factura = $('Parse AI Response').first().json;\nconst oc = $('Check OC').first().json;\nconst diffPct = Math.abs(factura.monto - oc.monto) / oc.monto;\nreturn [{ json: { ...factura, oc_monto: oc.monto, oc_moneda: oc.moneda, diff_pct: diffPct } }];"
      },
      "notes": "Umbral de tolerancia: 5%. Diferencias mayores no se autoaprueban (ver 'If Monto Diff')."
    },
    {
      "id": "w17",
      "name": "If Monto Diff",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2420,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.diff_pct }}",
              "rightValue": 0.05,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w18",
      "name": "Mark Excepcion Monto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2640,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "estado",
              "fieldValue": "excepcion_monto"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "motivo_excepcion",
              "fieldValue": "={{ \"Monto factura \" + $json.monto + \" difiere \" + (Math.round($json.diff_pct * 1000) / 10) + \"% de la OC (\" + $json.oc_monto + \")\" }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Update Factura - Extraida').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w19",
      "name": "Check Proveedor Moneda",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2640,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "proveedores",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "nombre",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.proveedor }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "id": "w20",
      "name": "If Moneda Distinta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2860,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Compute Diff Monto').first().json.moneda }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $json.moneda_esperada }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Edge case: factura en una moneda distinta a la que ese proveedor usa habitualmente (ej. Global Reefer Parts factura en ARS cuando siempre facturó en USD) nunca se convierte sola, se marca excepción."
    },
    {
      "id": "w21",
      "name": "Mark Excepcion Moneda",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3080,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "estado",
              "fieldValue": "excepcion_moneda"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "motivo_excepcion",
              "fieldValue": "={{ \"Moneda \" + $('Compute Diff Monto').first().json.moneda + \" distinta a la esperada (\" + $json.moneda_esperada + \") para este proveedor\" }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Update Factura - Extraida').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w22",
      "name": "Mark Pendiente Aprobacion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3300,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "estado",
              "fieldValue": "pendiente_aprobacion"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Update Factura - Extraida').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Punto de confluencia: cualquiera de las 4 excepciones (baja confianza, sin OC, monto, moneda) termina acá antes de notificar. La decisión humana la toma el workflow separado workflow-approval.json."
    },
    {
      "id": "w23",
      "name": "Alert - Pendiente Aprobacion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        3520,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": "#andesfreight-cuentas-a-pagar",
        "text": "=Factura {{ $json.numero_factura }} de {{ $json.proveedor }} (${{ $json.monto }} {{ $json.moneda }}) necesita aprobación: {{ $json.motivo_excepcion }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "w24",
      "name": "Mark Conciliada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3080,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "facturas",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "estado",
              "fieldValue": "conciliada"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "conciliado_en",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Update Factura - Extraida').item.json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Único camino que llega acá sin pasar por aprobación humana: pasó dedup, confianza, OC y monto, y la moneda coincide con la esperada del proveedor."
    },
    {
      "id": "w25",
      "name": "Notify - Conciliada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        3300,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": "#andesfreight-cuentas-a-pagar",
        "text": "=Factura {{ $json.numero_factura }} de {{ $json.proveedor }} conciliada automáticamente contra OC {{ $json.numero_oc }}."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Email Trigger - Facturas": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upload Attachment",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Upload Attachment": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Insert Factura (Raw)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Insert Factura (Raw)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract With AI",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
